  "body": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-bright-blue-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hans/\">简体中文</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-blue-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/\">English</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">HokkienLang 是一個透過〈<strong><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">東寧音<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.1em;left: 0.8em\">당ˉ롕임ˆ</rt></ruby></strong></strong>〉來探索<strong>閩南語</strong>（又稱作<strong>福建話</strong>、<strong>台灣話</strong>）的空間——這是一套專為讓閩南語的發音、聲調和語音變化更容易視覺化而設計的書寫系統。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">東寧音，為何？</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">閩南語（泉漳片）在全球有超過 2,500 萬使用人口，卻仍極少見於日常書寫。<strong><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">漢字<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">한`띠ˉ</rt></ruby></span></strong>雖能保留詞義與詞彙辨識，卻不一定能清楚呈現實際讀音；羅馬拼音雖能清楚標示語音，卻與<strong>漢字文化圈</strong>的書寫傳統相去較遠。</p>\n\n\n\n<img src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/458d8131d783-vowels-illustration.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3034\" style=\"width:125px;height:auto;float:right\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\"><a href=\"/zh-hant/learn/introduction/\">東寧音</a><rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.1em;left: 0.8em\">당ˉ롕임ˆ-</rt></ruby></strong>以諺文為基礎，利用音節方塊呈現閩南語的音節、聲調與變調，並主要用於<strong>漢字—諺文混寫</strong>：漢字承載詞義與詞彙身分，諺文則在需要時明確標示讀音。如須完全採用表音書寫，仍可採用純諺文（如教育用途上）。</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">類似的字形，不同的語言</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">以「<strong>學生</strong>」這個詞為例：</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">韓語：<strong>학생</strong> (<em>hak-saeng</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">閩南語（東寧音）：<strong><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">學生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.72em\">학솅ˆ</rt></ruby></span></strong> (<em>hak-siêng</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">兩者看似相近，讀音卻仍屬閩南語。東寧音借鑑諺文的音節方塊，尤其針對其<strong>聲調與變調</strong>加以調整，使其契合閩南語音韻，同時也與漢字自然並用。</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">學習東寧音</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hant/learn/introduction/\">以中文（繁）開始學習</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-bright-blue-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hans/learn/introduction/\">以中文（简）开始学习</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-blue-background-color has-background has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/learn/introduction/\">Start learning in English</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">變調解析</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">想要獲取更進階的知識嗎？<br>點選下方來探索閩南語韻律感背後的聲調機制。</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--8\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hant/learn/tone-sandhi/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">閩南語的變調規則</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">文學讀物</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-small-font-size wp-duotone-unset-9\"><img data-attachment-id=\"3032\" data-permalink=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/the-egg/\" data-orig-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/the-egg.png\" data-orig-size=\"707,841\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Egg\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/the-egg.png?w=707\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-3032\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/a544aeacfa20-the-egg.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" loading=\"lazy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/zh-hant/read/stories/the-egg/\"><b><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"nn̄g\">卵<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.4em;left: 0.4em\">능ˉ</rt></ruby></b></a></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><img data-attachment-id=\"7199\" data-permalink=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/%e7%9b%ae%e9%8c%84-directory/naikiengki/\" data-orig-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/naikiengki.png\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1024\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"naikiengki\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/naikiengki.png?w=1024\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-7199 size-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/content/wordpress/c9a8f25fedf3-naikiengki.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" loading=\"lazy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph\"><b><a href=\"/read/literature/lychee-mirror/\" title=\"荔鏡記\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"nai-kièng-ki\">荔鏡記<rt style=\"font-size: 50%;position: absolute;top: -1.4em;left: 1.6em\">내곙`기</rt></ruby></a></b><span style=\"display: inline-block;text-align: center;width: 100%;font-size: 0.5em\">（建置中）</span></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-default\">\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">歌曲</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote has-medium-font-size\"><blockquote><p>從經典金曲到新生樂團，這裡集結了台灣與南洋的歌謠創作，讓每段旋律裡的溫度，為你細細收藏生活裡各種獨特的心情。</p></blockquote></figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">當代流行</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-63375db1 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/2025/07/09/向前走-형졩걀-諺文歌詞/\">向前走</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/浪溜嗹/\">浪流連</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/敢傻敢衝/\">敢傻敢衝</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/곻愛릐一擺/\">閣愛妳一擺</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/헤비運將情歌/\">Happy!!! 運將情歌</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/一吋相思一吋淚/\">一吋相思一吋淚</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/寫一條歌寫릐꽈爾爾/\">寫一條歌，寫你我爾爾</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/愛情릐比꽈想에곻較偉大/\">愛情你比我想的閣較偉大</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">都市抒情</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/門/\">門</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/메삐메삐/\">Maybe Maybe</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/에흐로때디/\">Aphrodite (Αφροδίτη)</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/手捧一杯酒/\">手捧一杯酒</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">熱播金曲</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/家後/\">家後</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/堅持/\">堅持</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/꽈問天/\">我問天</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/小雨傘/\">小雨傘</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/愛情챻챻/\">愛情恰恰</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/歡喜就好/\">歡喜就好</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/愛拚才會贏/\">愛拚才會贏</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-dusk-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/酒後에心聲/\">酒後的心聲</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">深夜獨白</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/無眠/\">無眠</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/落雨聲/\">落雨聲</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/浪子回頭/\">浪子回頭</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/阿媽에話/\">阿嬤的話</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/songs/生份에릐/\">生份的你</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-midnight-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" hre